# Vertebra conventions

- Monorepo: `frontend/` (Astro) + `studio/` (Sanity). Pattern from Growth Lab / `@astro-sanity-starter`.
- Import direction: `pages/views → modules → components/ui|cards`. Never invert.
- 1 Sanity page-builder object = 1 Astro module. Variants via `layout`/`variant`.
- Locales: `es` (default), `en`. Routes in `frontend/src/i18n/routes.ts`.
- Webflow export lives in `docs/reference/webflow/` — reference only, not deployable routes.
- URL scope: see `docs/URL_MAP.md`. Do not rebuild legacy pages; use 301 redirects.
- Legal pages stay on `app.vertebra.co`.
- Prefer fixtures when Sanity is unavailable.
- Run `npm run check` after substantive frontend changes.
